WorkBuddy2API modifications notice
=================================

This repository is a modified source distribution of WorkBuddy2API.

Original project:
  Author: Sliverkiss
  Repository: https://github.com/Sliverkiss/workbuddy2api
  License: MIT

Community enhanced branch used as a source reference:
  Author/repository: https://github.com/287775856/workbuddy2api

Modification in this repository:
  - Skip CN-only scheduled activities (daily check-in and cat travel) for
    Global accounts whose auth domain is workbuddy.ai or a subdomain.
  - Port the /v1/stats request metrics endpoint so workbuddy2api-gui can
    display per-model request statistics.
  - Keep the complete dual-realm model catalog (cn:/global: prefixes) from
    the upstream project instead of truncating it to a CLI allow-list.
  - Add an OpenAI Responses API compatibility layer (`POST /v1/responses`)
    that translates requests to Chat Completions and emits the semantic
    streaming events Codex expects.
  - Preserve the original MIT license and upstream copyright notice.

No credentials, auths/, data/, local configuration, account identifiers,
email addresses, or local filesystem paths are included in this source
distribution.
